{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937950/extras/eb41028401121f6f38590c37a798fdd2.poster.avif?t=1769446278\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937950/extras/eb41028401121f6f38590c37a798fdd2.webm?t=1769446278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937950/extras/eb41028401121f6f38590c37a798fdd2.mp4?t=1769446278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>My Dear Farm</strong>\u2014the definitive PC edition! After charming over <strong>20 million</strong> mobile players, our cozy farming &amp; decorating sim blooms on Steam with upgraded controls and fresh PC-only content.<br><br>Grow, Decorate, Unwind</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant at your own pace:</strong> crops, fruit trees, and flowers keep growing while you\u2019re away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your dream homestead:</strong> freely place barns, fences, and paths (snap grid optional).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make it yours:</strong> furnish the farmhouse and craft picture-perfect nooks for Photo Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet cute characters:</strong> friendly neighbors, daily quests, and seasonal events bring the world to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937950/extras/3f803819ef13aa5de3f8727b68198731.poster.avif?t=1769446278\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937950/extras/3f803819ef13aa5de3f8727b68198731.webm?t=1769446278\" type=\"video/webm; codec